# Keep context lean; do NOT ignore package source.
# Host dist for service must not ship orphans into the builder COPY layer
# (tsc does not delete removed files). service build also does rm -rf dist.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.turbo
release
*.tar.gz
packages/service/dist
packages/web/dist
packages/web/dist-business
packages/web/dist-admin
# Note: do not ignore packages/shared/dist or enterprise/dist in a way that
# confuses tooling — builder always rebuilds; excluding only large web/service
# host artifacts is enough.
.bossmode-attachments
docs
